 Machine: A Living Knowledge Base" (copy "F7 lead") (ulist-of "Lisp Machine sub-features") (code-of "History evaluation, verbatim") (quasiquote (p (@ (class "lead") (style "margin-top:18px")) "The definition was changed between the two calls. The second asks for the " "earlier cut and gets the behaviour that was there then."))) (sec "measured" "Measured" "Numbers, and where they came from" #f (nums-panel "Numbers") (note-of "How the numbers were taken")) (sec "start" "Start" "A store is a directory" #f (code-of "Quickstart") (quasiquote (p (@ (class "lead") (style "margin-top:22px")) (unquote (copy "Install")))))))) (doc . "") (parent . "8pniyrtk.2") (ord . 80))))
